softer, healthier hair"]}],["$","p","8",{"children":["No flakes or dryness, ensuring a clean look throughout the day"]}],["$","h3","9",{"children":"Key Ingredients:"}],["$","p","10",{"className":"official-copy__item","children":"Beeswax – Delivers strong hold and structure"}],["$","p","11",{"className":"official-copy__item","children":"Shea Butter & Mango Butter – Add smoothness, shine, and moisture"}],["$","p","12",{"className":"official-copy__item","children":"Olive Oil & Avocado Oil – Nourish and soften hair while enhancing natural luster"}],["$","p","13",{"className":"official-copy__item","children":"Vitamin E – Protects hair from damage and promotes healthy growth"}],["$","h3","14",{"children":"Why You’ll Love It:"}],["$","p","15",{"className":"official-copy__item","children":"Strong hold that lasts all day"}],["$","p","16",{"className":"official-copy__item","children":"High shine for a clean, polished finish"}],["$","p","17",{"className":"official-copy__item","children":"Smooth, easy application"}],["$","p","18",{"className":"official-copy__item","children":"Doesn’t flake or dry out your hair"}],["$","p","19",{"className":"official-copy__item","children":"Made with high-quality, hair-friendly natural ingredients"}]]}]]}]
