e":"Olive + coconut oil","purpose":"Nourishment and natural sheen"}],"howTo":["Start with dry or slightly damp hair.","Warm a fingertip-sized amount between both palms.","Work from roots to ends, then build only where you need more hold.","Use fingertips for texture or a comb for a cleaner shape."],"image":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0723/0128/1561/files/DNOBPM_S.png?v=1759848547","altImage":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0723/0128/1561/files/8ygiubj.png?v=1759848547","accent":"#6d625c","officialUrl":"https://haxxedgrooming.com/products/clay-pomade","ratingApproximate":false}}],["$","$L1a","moulding-gel",{"product":{"slug":"moulding-gel","name":"MOULDING GEL","kind":"Hair","price":599,"mrp":799,"inStock":false,"hold":5,"shine":5,"holdLabel":"Maximum hold","finish":"Wet look","bestFor":"Glossy, set styles","cardLine":"🌿 100 % naturally derived styling agents","short":"This plant-based hair styling gel delivers maximum hold and a sleek, high-gloss finish without harsh chemicals or residue.","description":"This plant-based hair styling gel delivers maximum hold and a sleek, high-gloss finish without harsh chemicals or residue. Enriched with botanical extracts and naturally derived fixatives, it keeps your hair in place all day while adding a healthy, polished shine.","benefits":["🌿 100 % naturally derived styling agents","💪 Strong, long-lasting hold","💎 High-shine finish for a polished look","💧 Non-drying, non-flaking formula","🧴 Alcohol-free, silicone-free, paraben-free","✅ Suitable for all hair types"],"ingredients":[{"name":"Aloe vera juice","purpose":"Hydration and scalp comfort"},{"name":"Flaxseed extract","purpose":"Natural hold and shine"},{"name":"Plant glycerin","purpose":"Moisture retention"},{"name":"Natural polymers","purpose":"Strong flexible hold"}],"howTo":["Apply to damp hair for an even wet finish.","Spread a small amount across both hands.","Comb or rake through quickly before it sets.","Allow to dry, then avoid over-touching for maximum shine."],"image":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0723/0128/1561/files/JDAOSDVEA.png?v=1759852812","altImage":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0723/0128/1561/files/lshw3el.png?v=1759852812","accent":"#336ca0","officialUrl":"https://haxxedgrooming.com/products/moulding-gel","ratingApproximate":false}}],"$L1b"]}]]}]
